                                "sense_id": "49b92b54-0b40-3584-a44d-96d3b0992c73",
                                "text": "‘Ye should tear up this carpet, Robbie,’ Uncle Peter called back over his shoulder. ‘It's most unco wearisome when a body′s leg-weary.’"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b690ee5e-b536-4145-8607-9ac3bc31996e",
                                "sense_id": "49b92b54-0b40-3584-a44d-96d3b0992c73",
                                "text": "Jamie has met only two kids of women: the mainly elderly and unco good who belong to his father's congregation, and those who drink in pubs and shebeens used by nearly penniless medical students."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
